# Figma private npm registry configuration TEMPLATE.
#
# Copy this file to `.npmrc.figma` (which is gitignored) and replace the
# contents with the snippet from your Figma organization:
#   Figma > Admin > Resources > npm registry > View configuration
#
# The real snippet looks like the two lines below, with your org's host/path
# and a freshly generated auth token. Keep the token secret — never commit it.
#
# @mcafee-eng:registry=https://www.figma.com/api/npm-registry/<org>/
# //www.figma.com/api/npm-registry/<org>/:_authToken=<YOUR_TOKEN>
